  "releaseNotes": "### 🚀 Features\n\n* Add `--dry-run` flag allowing to preview a summary of the changes ([96c26eb](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/96c26eb1fb3b9a940b7670a2c224f4b052ba3d2b))\n\n    This even works in dirty directory.\n\n    The main usage of this flag is for checking that you correctly setted up\n    your repository\n* Ignore well known folders (`fable_modules`, `node_modules`) ([c0fb635](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/c0fb635b08bbc169b5f31b4567217eddf5e64e27))\n\n### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n* Retrieve a higher number of Labels (100) ([3a45d9f](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/3a45d9f68c6affc696bc678b2d5e3371bacdf510))\n\n<strong><small>[View changes on Github](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/compare/96ec82ebdf5d77ffc31c78be02259f175caeb61d..c0fb635b08bbc169b5f31b4567217eddf5e64e27)</small></strong>",
